purchase': In-store purchase with PIN","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"clause":"card_in_possession asked","quote":"Ask: "Do you still have your physical debit card in your possession?" This affects fraud classification.","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"clause":"pin_compromised asked, unknown if unsure","quote":"'unknown': Customer unsure","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"}]}},{"step":"pin_lock_no_unauthorized_no_dispute","verdict":"rewrite","why":"The fixed window is unsupported, and the claim that no money was taken is not in doc 041, which instead says to explain the security concern and offer the options.","clauses":[{"clause":"window from the earliest declined attempt to the current time","kind":"unsupported","source":"Doc 041 gives the suspicious period no bounds."},{"clause":"tell the customer no money was taken (declined attempts take no money)","kind":"unsupported","source":"No passage states this. Doc 041 says 'Explain the security concern and offer options'."},{"clause":"file nothing and do not start this job","kind":"derived","source":"Doc 041 step 6 files a dispute only 'If unauthorized transactions found'. Otherwise it offers options."},{"clause":"return to the protocol's options","kind":"derived","source":"Doc 041 step 6 item 3 lists closure and replacement, security team transfer, and PIN reset."}],"rewrite":{"id":"pin_lock_no_unauthorized_no_dispute","by":"model","do":"On a card that cannot be unlocked, the PIN lock check may find only declined attempts and no successful transaction the customer denies. Doc 041 does not bound the suspicious period. Show the customer the successful transactions on the card from the earliest declined PIN attempt (type 'atm_withdrawal_declined' or 'pos_declined') in get_transactions that led to the lock up to the current time from get_time, and ask whether any of them, or any other recent successful transaction on the card, was not theirs.
